{"id":"n18855-1-10","stage":4,"title":"고작 · 才","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18855-1-10-1","ko":"여기가 다른 가게보다 물건값이 싸다며?","zh":"这里的东西比别的店便宜，是吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기가","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"其他，别的","explanation":"다른：其他，别的","readings":[{"term":"다른","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64530","senseId":"1","lemma":"다른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가게보다","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물건값이","meaning":"商品，物品；价格，价钱","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；값：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"},{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"1","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸다며?","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"f1f4ce417552e197","term":"다른","zh":"其他，别的","audio":"/audio/f1f4ce417552e1974311.mp3","entryId":"64530","definition":"除相关之外的。","pronunciation":["다른"]},{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"b19ddf94b4c9896b","term":"값","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3","entryId":"20178","definition":"给买卖的东西划定的货币数量。","pronunciation":["갑"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/69f605b8dd39ddd9d6cf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18855-1-10-2","ko":"그래봤자 고작 몇백 원 차이야.","zh":"就算这样，也就只差几百韩元而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래봤자","meaning":"即使那样，也不过……","explanation":"그렇다：那样；-아/어 봤자：即使如此也没有多大作用。这里强调虽然便宜，也只便宜几百韩元。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고작","meaning":"才，刚，就，只不过","explanation":"고작：才，刚，就，只不过","readings":[{"term":"고작","audio":"/audio/03f4971e6b62fad2c220.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18855","senseId":"1","lemma":"고작","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇백","meaning":"几；百","explanation":"몇：几；백：百","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"},{"term":"백","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"1","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"36019","senseId":"1","lemma":"백","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원","meaning":"韩元，韩币","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차이야.","meaning":"差异，差别","explanation":"차이：差异，差别；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"차이","audio":"/audio/b9b47d9dee081fdee3de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62404","senseId":"1","lemma":"차이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"那样","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"表示先做前面所指的行为，再考虑后来的事情。","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示先做前面所指的行为，再考虑后来的事情。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"03f4971e6b62fad2","term":"고작","zh":"才，刚，就，只不过","audio":"/audio/03f4971e6b62fad2c220.mp3","entryId":"18855","definition":"就算再计较或再琢磨也仅仅。","pronunciation":["고작"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"数目不定的小数字。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"f30a48779ab0b5cd","term":"백","zh":"百","audio":"/audio/f30a48779ab0b5cdf1b3.mp3","entryId":"36019","definition":"十的十倍的数目。","pronunciation":["백"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"韩元，韩币","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3","entryId":"27771","definition":"韩国货币单位。","pronunciation":["원"]},{"id":"b9b47d9dee081fde","term":"차이","zh":"差异，差别","audio":"/audio/b9b47d9dee081fdee3de.mp3","entryId":"62404","definition":"互不相同；或指相互间不同的程度。","pronunciation":["차이"]}],"audio":"/audio/1435a2788347eb2c0641.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.337,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18855","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.1637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["就算这样，也就只差几百韩元而已。","听说我们小区要建地铁站了。","这里的东西比别的店便宜，是吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["就算这样，也就只差几百韩元而已。","这里的东西比别的店便宜，是吗？","听说我们小区要建地铁站了。"],"answer":0}]}
